 "title": "审计与上线",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 115.87,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "测试做足了，才轮到外部审计。",
   "spoken": "测试做足了，才轮到外部审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.186
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "审计期间冻结代码，审计的对象，是某一个提交哈希。",
   "spoken": "审计期间冻结代码，审计的对象，是某一个提交哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.252,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 5.35,
   "speechEnd": 9.564
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "把规格、威胁模型、已知风险和测试覆盖率，一起交给审计方。",
   "spoken": "把规格、威胁模型、已知风险和测试覆盖率，一起交给审计方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.632,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 10.73,
   "speechEnd": 16.051
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "关键协议，请两家以上审计，各有侧重。",
   "spoken": "关键协议，请两家以上审计，各有侧众。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.092,
   "dur": 4.464,
   "speechStart": 17.19,
   "speechEnd": 20.725
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "也可以在 Code4rena、Sherlock、Cantina 这类平台办审计竞赛，覆盖面更广。",
   "spoken": "也可以在 Code4rena、Sherlock、Cantina 这类平台办审计竞赛，覆盖面更广。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.776,
   "dur": 7.08,
   "speechStart": 21.874,
   "speechEnd": 28.016
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "修复本身也可能带来新漏洞，所以修完要复审。",
   "spoken": "修复本身也可能带来新漏洞，所以修完要复审。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 29.076,
   "dur": 4.848,
   "speechStart": 29.174,
   "speechEnd": 33.09
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "编译器版本也要记下来，查它有没有已知 bug，2023 年的 Vyper 事故，就出在编译器上。",
   "spoken": "编译器版本也要记下来，查它有没有已知 bug，2023 年的 Vyper 事故，就出在编译器上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 34.144,
   "dur": 7.104,
   "speechStart": 34.242,
   "speechEnd": 40.408
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "审计之后，审计范围内的代码，一个字都不能再改。",
   "spoken": "审计之后，审计范围内的代码，一个字都不能再改。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 41.468,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 41.566,
   "speechEnd": 45.804
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "接着是部署。",
   "spoken": "接着是部署。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 46.848,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 46.946,
   "speechEnd": 47.886
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "用脚本部署，不手动操作，脚本本身也要评审。",
   "spoken": "用脚本部署，不手动操作，脚本本身也要评审。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 48.94,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 49.038,
   "speechEnd": 52.966
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "部署和初始化，放在同一笔交易里完成。",
   "spoken": "部署和初始化，放在同一笔交易里完成。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 54.032,
   "dur": 3.768,
   "speechStart": 54.13,
   "speechEnd": 56.951
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "部署后在区块浏览器上验证源码，再跑一个验证脚本，把关键参数逐个读出来，和预期对比。",
   "spoken": "部署后在区块浏览器上验证源码，再跑一个验证脚本，把关键参数逐个读出来，和预期对比。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 58.02,
   "dur": 8.04,
   "speechStart": 58.118,
   "speechEnd": 65.213
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "最后，把权限从部署账户移交给多签和时间锁，撤销部署账户的所有角色。",
   "spoken": "最后，把权限从部署账户移交给多签和时间锁，撤销部署账户的所有决色。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 66.28,
   "dur": 7.32,
   "speechStart": 66.378,
   "speechEnd": 72.759
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "还有一件常被跳过的事，在目标链上测。",
   "spoken": "还有一件常被跳过的事，在目标链上测。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 73.82,
   "dur": 3.744,
   "speechStart": 73.918,
   "speechEnd": 76.751
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "在以太坊上测过，不代表在目标链上能跑。",
   "spoken": "在以太坊上测过，不代表在目标链上能跑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 77.784,
   "dur": 3.912,
   "speechStart": 77.882,
   "speechEnd": 80.858
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "在 BNB Chain 上，BSC-USD 的精度是 18 位。",
   "spoken": "在 BNB Chain 上，BSC-USD 的精度是 18 位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 81.916,
   "dur": 4.584,
   "speechStart": 82.014,
   "speechEnd": 85.68
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "出块间隔是 0.45 秒，相邻两个区块的秒级时间戳，可能一样。",
   "spoken": "出块间隔是 0.45 秒，相邻两个区块的秒级时间戳，可能一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 86.72,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 86.818,
   "speechEnd": 91.877
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "在 TRON 上，要实测 USDT 转账的返回值，去 Nile 或 Shasta 测试网跑，不要只用本地 EVM。",
   "spoken": "在 TRON 上，要实测 USDT 转账的返回值，去 Nile 或 Shasta 测试网跑，不要只用本地 EVM。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 92.94,
   "dur": 8.712,
   "speechStart": 93.038,
   "speechEnd": 100.823
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "在 Mantle 上，随交易附带的原生币是 MNT，ETH 只是一个 ERC-20 代币。",
   "spoken": "在 Mantle 上，随交易附带的原生币是 MNT，ETH 只是一个 ERC-20 代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 101.872,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 101.97,
   "speechEnd": 107.708
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "部署前，在目标链的测试网或者主网分叉上，把完整测试跑一遍。",
   "spoken": "部署前，在目标链的测试网或者主网分岔上，把完整测试跑一遍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
